@startuml
' Figure 5.8  The decision record lifecycle
' Reading order: top to bottom from proposed to reaffirmed or superseded.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide empty description
[*] --> Proposed
Proposed --> Accepted : Review signs
Accepted --> Reopened : Reversal condition met
Reopened --> Accepted : Reaffirmed, new evidence
Reopened --> Superseded : New record replaces it
Superseded --> [*]
@enduml
